<title>FRANCE: La Rochette suspended limit up.</title>
<headline>La Rochette suspended limit up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in wood pulp and packaging company La Rochette were suspended limit up after a 10 percent rise at 0841 GMT.</p>
<p>Trading resumed after a 15 minute pause.</p>
<p>At 0900 GMT, La Rochette was up 7.14 percent at 24.75 francs in a turnover of 2.6 million francs.</p>
